{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13205070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13205070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1320507001:1":{"text":"Two of them are safe and sound, but the last one is still missing.","source_cn":"已经平安回来了两只羊，只差最后那只老羊了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAE60AF2AFA94F54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320507002:1":{"text":"Also, Sasha isn't back yet...","source_cn":"不过，萨莎也还没回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4144E175D2D738A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320507003:1":{"text":"We didn't see her. Maybe she's still trying to find the other sheep.","source_cn":"我们刚才没看见它，它很可能是去找你说的那只羊了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB133B90D02F7505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320507004:1":{"text":"Let's wait and see. Chippy thinks that Sasha will definitely find that one.","source_cn":"再耐心等等看吧！有萨莎在，它们肯定没事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69AE5C81B279BBFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320507005:1":{"text":"You may not know this, but snow wolves often appear in these hills. Shepherds have been known to lose the occasional sheep or goat.","source_cn":"唉呀，你们不知道……这片山区经常有雪地狼出没，我们这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE74DE57E657073D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320507006:1":{"text":"Can you please help me <style=\"highlight\">find Sasha and my last sheep</style>? My family makes their living on these sheep. We can't afford to lose even one.","source_cn":"孩子们，你们能帮我<style=highlight>找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00C5306D9BE2AEEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1320507006":{"text":"Can you please help me <style=\"highlight\">find Sasha and my last sheep</style>? My family makes their living on these sheep. We can't afford to lose even one.","source_cn":"孩子们，你们能帮我<style=highlight>找找萨莎和那只老羊</style>吗？我们家全靠这些绵羊挣钱，可不能随随便便弄丢一只。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00C5306D9BE2AEEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320507008:1":{"text":"The sheep is old and has poor eyesight. It always wanders to the strangest places, so I put a bell on its collar so Sasha and I can find it more easily.","source_cn":"那只老羊年纪大了，眼睛不好使，总是跑到一些奇怪的地方去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC10A92CDC16F3CD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320507009:1":{"text":"Sasha probably heard the bell and went after it.","source_cn":"我估计，萨莎就是去追它的铃铛声了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C30978D5BF3A82D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1320507009":{"text":"Sasha probably heard the bell and went after it.","source_cn":"我估计，萨莎就是去追它的铃铛声了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C30978D5BF3A82D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320507010:1":{"text":"It's common practice. Shepherds who have a lot of sheep will put a bell on the sheep to prevent the herd from getting separated.","source_cn":"这有什么奇怪？像那些养着几十只羊的牧民，都会给领头羊戴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5F2DBFF9F2694E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320507012:1":{"text":"All you need to do is follow Sasha's pawprints, and you'll find both of them.","source_cn":"麻烦你们在附近找找<style=highlight>萨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AA91ECEEB9EF7DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"There are bells for sheep?","source_cn":"居然还有给羊戴的铃铛？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF3922E1FA4A6D63E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"There are bells for sheep?","female":"There are bells for sheep?","variant_male_record_index":"69634","variant_female_record_index":"69635","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320507011:1":{"text":"Don't worry. Sasha has good hearing. She is definitely tracking the last one right now.","source_cn":"不用担心这个，萨莎的听力很好，它听的可比咱们听的清楚多了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D671F3D44DC1F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"We didn't hear a bell.","source_cn":"但我们一直没听到铃铛声","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC594B924A96E688A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We didn't hear a bell.","female":"We didn't hear a bell.","variant_male_record_index":"69636","variant_female_record_index":"69637","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"What does the sheep look like?","source_cn":"那只羊有什么特点？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C86387623B21468","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What does the sheep look like?","female":"What does the sheep look like?","variant_male_record_index":"69630","variant_female_record_index":"69631","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320507007:1":{"text":"Clue...? It has a bell.","source_cn":"线索……铃铛声算不算？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E80AEC9A5C0FB1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"Any clues you can provide?","source_cn":"没线索的话，很难找","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x172431EEE61B9880","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":